<title>USA: U.S. wheat weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. wheat major net sales activity in the week ended Sept 19 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:    1996/97		   1997/98</p>
<p> Unknown	 91,800		    Nil</p>
<p> Japan	   74,300</p>
<p> Nigeria	 56,200</p>
<p> S Korea	 24,700</p>
<p> Britain	 18,100</p>
<p> Italy	   18,000</p>
<p> Colombia     -19,000</p>
<p>Net sales of 371,200 tonnes were 13 percent below the previous week and 27 percent under the four-week average.</p>
<p>Exports of 635,900 tonnes were 18 percent lower than the prior week.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Egypt, Pakistan, Japan, Poland, Mexico, South Africa and Tunisia.</p>
</text>
